# API registry (required)

Read `AGENTS.md` for full instructions.

## Architecture
- **Separate client & server** — deploy independently, no `shared/` folder
- **Separate env:** `client/.env` and `server/.env.local` only
- **No `apps/` folder** — use root `client/` and `server/`
- **No root node_modules**

## Node.js
- Minimum **Node 22+**

## Types and utils
- Duplicate types/utils in each app (no shared imports)

## Every API endpoint
1. Document in `docs/API-REGISTRY.md`

## README
Update `README.md` when setup, env, commands, architecture, or deployment changes. Link to `docs/` for detailed API and plan docs — do not duplicate them.
